The Loom is a pre-war megatower. Think of it as a vertical city, not a horizontal one.

Aspect	Dogtown Stadium	The Loom
Shape	Wide, sprawling arena	Tall, narrow tower
Movement	Horizontal streets	Vertical floors (only stairs)
